UnitActionHub::constructor
└── when called by a child contract
    └── it sets the parent

UnitActionHub::isHubChild
├── when the actions builder is a child
│   └── it returns true
└── when the actions builder is not a child
    └── it returns false

UnitActionHub::_saveNewActionsBuilder
└── When called
    ├── it marks the actions builder as a child
    └── it emits a NewActionsBuilderSaved event
